post-it: Icons don't open
cause: Screenshot set as wallpaper
symptoms:
	Icons don't open
	Can't open pictures
	Programs won't start
checks:
	yes: Icons visible on desktop
		shows: bottom right, mostly off the screen
	no: Can open files and folders on desktop
	no: Can select icons on desktop
software steps:
	Double-click the folder in the corner of the desktop
	Drag the icons in it out onto the desktop
	Right-click the desktop and select Properties
	Select any non-prank wallpaper
	Click Apply
